      "text": "4 ORDINANCE NO. 20658"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 3,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 4,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "AN ORDINANCE introduced by City Manager, Robert M. Perez, allowing and approving"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 5,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "City expenditures for the period of February 28, 2026, to April 3, 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 6,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "and enumerating said expenditures herein. 9"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 7,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "BE IT ORDAINED BY THE COUNCIL OF THE CITY OF TOPEKA, KANSAS:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 8,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "Section 1. All expenditures made or authorized to be made by issuance of checks"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 9,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "or electronic transfers as enumerated herein, are in accordance with City of Topeka"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 10,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "Resolution No. 7607."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 11,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "Section 2. The claims and expenditures listed in Exhibit A, which is on file in the"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 12,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "City Council Office and the City Clerk’s Office and incorporated herein by said reference,"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 13,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "are hereby allowed and approved for payment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "table",
      "order": 14,
      "table_index": 0,
      "text": "17\tSection 3.\tTotal of 308 vendor checks written this period\t1,181,258.52\n18\t\tTotal of 562 ACH transfers to vendors this period\t14,430,631.99\n19\t\tTotal of 4,791 payroll electronic transfers this period\t2,250,021.53\n20\t\tTotal of 1 payroll check written this period\t945.39\n21\t\tTotal for expenditures in this period\t$17,862,857.43"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 15,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "Section 4. This ordinance shall take effect and be in force after its passage,"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 16,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "approval and publication in the official city newspaper."
    },
